{"time": 1762780823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474125992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“刻晴，20岁”"}
{"time": 1762780859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683529240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哥伦比亚7位优秀青年才俊，也就是哥伦比亚七星的一员（））"}
{"time": 1762780870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624847982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "先把上次外出考察借用的冰镐和无人机换回去本部吧。"}
{"time": 1762780887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685823644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“需要做哪些测试？”"}
{"time": 1762780894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138020974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "数据已经上传到云端了，后天才处理了。"}
{"time": 1762780894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901211725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1624847982]（哪来的）"}
{"time": 1762780919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754714431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "诶，怎么本部门口这么多人？"}
{"time": 1762780945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960251599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1685823644]“体能测试，源石技艺测试，此外，还需要压力测试。”他记录着什么，“要去北境，环境恶劣，刚刚毕业？”"}
{"time": 1762780946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650125224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（借公司的）"}
{"time": 1762781008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287841151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....不过之前有跟过实习去冰原，所以有些经验”"}
{"time": 1762781071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91948738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（怎么刚刚那个紫色头发的妹妹，发型这么像以前那个很吵的前辈）"}
{"time": 1762781088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85778996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=754714431]（并非一天，）"}
{"time": 1762781236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576540219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=138020974]本部里常年弥漫着过量咖啡豆的香味，时不时还会传出一些大声的叫骂，在这个聚集了全球最顶尖头脑的公司里，这倒是常态。你轻车熟路地往宿舍走，随身的终端此时倒是轻轻响了一下。"}
{"time": 1762781259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518379382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "菲拉穿过人群，按向了工程科的电梯。工程科的露工检查了你归还的冰镐和无人机，并且在设备借用表上签收，“你这次没有对无人机做什么了吧。”"}
{"time": 1762781262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861586473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1287841151]“实习？”他添了一笔，“还行，你去做一下体质测试吧，之后还要做个化验。”"}
{"time": 1762781301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628737176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，谢谢”去做体质测试"}
{"time": 1762781334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "666129906", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1576540219]菲拉尴尬的笑了一下，终端适时的响了一下，刚好打开终端看看是谁在找你。"}
{"time": 1762781367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209625746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（人称怎么感觉怪怪的）"}
{"time": 1762781407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866563354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1576540219] 菲拉尴尬的笑了一下，终端适时的响了一下，刚好打开终端看看是谁在找我。"}
{"time": 1762781434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1054240941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（为什么前面要加上菲拉（）"}
{"time": 1762781442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454748899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=628737176]“不过，我们这次去的地方有感染矿石病的风险，我提前跟你说，不像得病的话，现在就离开吧。”"}
{"time": 1762781479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830606548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不怕这些，这种实战经验非常宝贵，我不想错过”"}
{"time": 1762781515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230764038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“之后等通知吧。”他摆摆手，你可以离开了。"}
{"time": 1762781615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638887589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1866563354]是科学考察科的主任，你的直系上司马利亚姆，他的话很简短，“3号会议室，开会。”"}
{"time": 1762781638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089573940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”"}
{"time": 1762781644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301655517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去体质测试了"}
