{"time": 1762781706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419425733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（20才是感染者。）"}
{"time": 1762781754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474404927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“不是吧，按照正常情况来说我现在还在外出中啊，利主任怎么知道我回来了？”不管了，先去会议室吧。"}
{"time": 1762781773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361827656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=2388921818] [CQ:at,qq=825734198] [CQ:at,qq=1370316409] （谁导入）"}
