{"time": 1762785880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656152527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的指尖似乎滑过了一些属于液体的涟漪，随后画面切换的瞬间，除了斯薇塔之外的四人似乎捕捉到了一些不属于风暴的流光出现在风暴边缘，位于高空的位置，但画面切换，“这是三天前麦哲伦传回的画面。”画面中风暴已经几乎平息，只有偶尔的气旋出现在画面中各处，一座城镇若有若现"}
{"time": 1762785884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929979798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我就知道龙要这么说）"}
{"time": 1762785931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130445845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（该成长了）"}
{"time": 1762785991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123181107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那所城镇是？”"}
{"time": 1762786005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "746508796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(我要问了)"}
{"time": 1762786018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287122248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(要不要博学可以从古籍里想到的)"}
{"time": 1762786102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345276880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（saki是不是没改备注）"}
{"time": 1762786112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688505094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“萨米有这么大规模的镇子吗？我印象里很少见到这种规模的。”"}
{"time": 1762786118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833445587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。sn"}
{"time": 1762786118, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1833445587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "已将[我叫五个五]的群名片修改为[斯薇塔 hp80/{HPMAX} san40/40 dex3]"}
{"time": 1762786130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661071532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（手动改，小雅不是管理）"}
{"time": 1762786194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546268818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“这个不会是传说中古代拉特兰教义中的失落之城吧”"}
{"time": 1762786236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553561118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“拉特兰教义的失落之城应该也不会在这么北边的地方吧？”"}
{"time": 1762786270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127037728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“所以才会组织这次的考察队咯。”她摆摆手，画面从你们眼前消散，“生态科会提供各位一定程度的支援。”"}
{"time": 1762786303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928801964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={40A7A763-1F3D-A222-0C80-706C8326E083}.gif,sub_type=1,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-40A7A7631F3DA2220C80706C8326E083/0,file_size=990461]"}
{"time": 1762786306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305786674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“一定程度”"}
{"time": 1762786363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601334504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“一定程度按照生态科的意思”"}
{"time": 1762786375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2116588355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“应该，可能，大概有防寒服吧”"}
{"time": 1762786413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535130970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（莱茵生命五科四务都在你肩上担着对吧，缪姐）"}
{"time": 1762786516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671415789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"防寒服当然不可或缺，此外特殊装备还请几位在今天晚间的时候申请。具体的交给生态科审查。\""}
{"time": 1762786524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116537925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“缪主任，这个源石风暴这等规模，您看总辖都亲自下来指导这个项目，还关乎我们公司在极北之地未来的发展，是不是应该提供更多的资源呢？”"}
{"time": 1762786665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640646462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...?现在可是平息了诶。\"她的指尖搭在唇前，\"马里亚斯，你家的小羊想要什么坦克车开吗？\""}
{"time": 1762786754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979292914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“源石风暴随时可能再度加强卷冰重来，我们在极北真的可以租借到军用坦克吗？”"}
{"time": 1762786768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216696802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不知道。\"马里亚斯摆出一副事不关己的样子，\"你们生态科不是有钱的很，真要说也能弄到吧。\""}
{"time": 1762786790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763007711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（生态科有钱的很，不买是生态科的问题？）"}
{"time": 1762786843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280258419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（原来伊拉诺扮演的是缪尔赛思）"}
{"time": 1762786849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902907007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（他最喜欢的角色）"}
{"time": 1762786849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "109708145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"别想了，搞不到的。\"缪尔赛斯翻了个白眼，\"除了必要的防寒服和药品，其余支援请自行申请，只限今天，逾期不补。\""}
{"time": 1762786870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405141797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“严格来说，应该是可以的”"}
{"time": 1762786873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124880157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*嘀嘀咕咕"}
{"time": 1762786899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317255031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（这老缪一肚子坏水啊）"}
{"time": 1762786950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "324256247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“萨米那个地形坦克真的能开动吗？”"}
{"time": 1762787015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370765418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就是说嘛。\"她对着斯薇塔认可地点点头，\"不过呢～\""}
{"time": 1762787029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166268061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "马上打印五张物资申请清单，然后给缪主任签名。“缪姐姐，我不耽误您的工作了，麻烦您在物质申请表上先签字？”"}
{"time": 1762787054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997182994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“具体申请的物料，我们随后再慢慢写！”"}
{"time": 1762787109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636692469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*在一旁看着"}
{"time": 1762787115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914658134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“斯工，您过来收集一下其他三位同事还有什么物质需要申请的。”"}
{"time": 1762787121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568059074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呵呵...\"她朝着你菲拉一甩手，不知何处来的清凉冷水洒了小羊一脸，\"想得美，写好之后交到生态科。\""}
{"time": 1762787126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91175462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“主任，我们申请完物资怎么前往科考地点啊？难道坐驮兽过去？”"}
{"time": 1762787242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8873676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“应该会给载具？”"}
{"time": 1762787302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395178228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "看到偷鸡不成，直接将申请表分发给众人。“极北虽然我司已经多次科考过，但是这次去的地方确实比较凶险，各位有什么需要的物资都写一下，我们公司都尽量会提供的。”"}
{"time": 1762787327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235345189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"从这里到那边，莱茵生命的专机只需要半天。\""}
{"time": 1762787351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622975101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“如何判定科考结束？”"}
{"time": 1762787357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435056988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“我们到时候要怎么联系”"}
{"time": 1762787370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396945522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“风暴里很多通信方式都会无法使用”"}
{"time": 1762787462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064133714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“莱茵生命应该有专门的科考站联络点吧，到时候我们到那里联系总部应该就行。”"}
{"time": 1762787483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919840243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过为什么麦哲伦前辈没有联络呢？”"}
{"time": 1762787503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974125032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "小羊从来都是习惯一个人独自科考，10m外不辨人声的她也从来没有想过这个问题。一时间感激的眼神投向了斯薇塔。"}
{"time": 1762787524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929687841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（麦哲伦遇到风暴，生死不明，那就是死了！）"}
{"time": 1762787525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032598164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"麦哲伦就在那边啦，这些都是小事。\"缪尔赛斯眨了眨眼，\"没有联络吗？大概因为都是走得固定线路和频率吧，三天才会有一次消息。\""}
{"time": 1762787535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540573695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "作为新人，还是多听多记比较好"}
{"time": 1762787576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016230266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“那就三天为定期吧，如果没有回复请派遣救援队”"}
{"time": 1762787761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380087906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说三天时间真的够遗迹到联络点的往返吗？”"}
{"time": 1762787821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110947143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我们还要完成探索任务。不过要是在野外扎营可以包在我身上，我小时候就会了！”"}
{"time": 1762787881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596991493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那就六天？”她似乎有些犹豫"}
{"time": 1762787984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324030554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“六天应该够完成任务了吧，携带的食物可以让我背，我力气还蛮大的，如果食物不过还可以打猎，这个也是我擅长的。”"}
{"time": 1762788023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34353862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“我们会在任务中一直保持联络”"}
{"time": 1762788032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256185367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "\"我也稍微会一点火焰的源石术，可以驱寒和紧急处理失温症。\""}
{"time": 1762788039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008745502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "。ra施术"}
{"time": 1762788039, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1008745502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲拉]进行技能[施术:80]检定: 1D100=43 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1762788041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536188245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“在这种地方迷失方向实在是过于致命”"}
{"time": 1762788046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310515941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（话说刻晴和不明所以的黎博利人呢）"}
{"time": 1762788057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825280555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1540573695]（）"}
{"time": 1762788059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1279721850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "一团小火苗在手掌燃起。"}
{"time": 1762788085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084209181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（黎博利睡着了）"}
{"time": 1762788112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904991072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“那我们这次的外出任务暂定为6天，我们队伍不少于24小时往附件站点发送报告。”"}
{"time": 1762788130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431295819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那就这样吧，我们会每天保持联络，如果有一天联络中断，我们就会三天内前往最近的科考站联络点，或者直到重新联络上为止。”"}
{"time": 1762788136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223713138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这样如何。”"}
{"time": 1762788142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405668422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“各位，请以这个为基准，按最不利的打算，申请物资吧”"}
{"time": 1762788186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354405731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“行，那这次行动的总负责人就交给你了。”"}
{"time": 1762788189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2009788756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "看着旁边站着睡着的黎博利和坐着睡着的多萝西主任，内心表示莱茵生命真是个摸鱼的好地方。"}
{"time": 1762788321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275108579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉？我还是实习生，就当上总负责人了？”"}
{"time": 1762788348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934121409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...此外我还有个不情之请。”她看了一眼马利亚斯，“生态科之所以援助此次行动..”"}
{"time": 1762788390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "444563496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“这次如果你表现的好，我可以给你申请调来我们SCIEN啊~！”"}
{"time": 1762788410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729030316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={7CE39E66-D404-9D8D-B253-1A705B0D27BD}.gif,sub_type=1,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-7CE39E66D4049D8DB2531A705B0D27BD/0,file_size=1109987]"}
{"time": 1762788423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098412237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那就不用了，多萝西主任对我挺好的。”"}
{"time": 1762788441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288383762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（和这样的的札拉克在一起，怎么搞得好科研）"}
{"time": 1762788492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935261780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "听到生态科主任开始说重点，马上往她看过去"}
{"time": 1762788730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212153301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(实际上，真睡着了)"}
{"time": 1762788732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523139188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟在北地，希望各位深入萨米的同时，可以留意精灵，这一种族相关的事情。\""}
{"time": 1762788756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757614319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1212153301]（就当他在游戏里也睡着了，反正是不明所以的黎博利）"}
{"time": 1762788756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792038664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说这话时，缪尔赛斯常年挂着的笑容罕见地收了起来。"}
{"time": 1762788818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223036103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“委托自然要完成，萨米的当地势力也应当是要拜访的”"}
{"time": 1762788849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570031246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“精灵吗，，我明白了”"}
{"time": 1762788987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597370753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（这老缪挪用公器私用啊。）"}
{"time": 1762788992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696352965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那如果没有什么要嘱咐的我们就先去领物资和装备吧，尽早完成任务，万一风暴再次扩大就不好办了。”"}
{"time": 1762789013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203986904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*说完牵着旁边睡着的黎博利准备去领物资。"}
{"time": 1762789066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121458796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "*跟着走出去搜刮物资"}
{"time": 1762789094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966783042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（搜刮，搁这搜打撤呢）"}
{"time": 1762789119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807862579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“准备好物资后我们要在前门集合吗？”"}
{"time": 1762789164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876053962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“在莱茵生命的停机坪集合吗，缪尔赛思主任？”"}
{"time": 1762789207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710264404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"明天早上八点，停机坪。\"缪尔赛斯挥挥手，\"好啦，今天记得交申请表。\"她重新挂上招牌的笑容。"}
{"time": 1762789283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785372172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“收到...”"}
{"time": 1762789323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886876733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后跟着出门领物资"}
{"time": 1762789329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143471953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*那就填申请表准备去后勤领物资，并且拿回我保养好的大剑。"}
{"time": 1762789349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "460156569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*回去收拾行李"}
{"time": 1762789398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461530266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么，中场休息。"}
